ting to enjoy the Costa del Sol climate.\nThe lower level is dedicated to leisure and wellbeing, featuring a stylish bar area, entertainment space with pool table, separate home cinema, fully equipped gym, and a spa area with sauna, indoor heated pool and jacuzzi. This thoughtfully designed level makes the villa as comfortable in the cooler months as it is in summer.\n\nKey features\nClassic Andalusian-inspired architecture\nPrivate gated entrance road\nPanoramic south-facing sea and mountain views\n4 ensuite bedrooms in the main house\nSeparate guest apartment with ensuite bedroom\nHigh-quality finishes throughout\nGazebo for outdoor dining and multiple terraces for ‌lounging ‌and ‌entertaining\nBBQ ‌areas ‌and ‌infinity pool ‌overlooking the ‌mountains and sea\nLeisure level with ‌bar, ‌games ‌area, ‌home ‌cinema, gym and spa\nSpa ‌with ‌sauna, ‌indoor ‌heated ‌pool ‌and ‌jacuzzi"},"features":{"es":["Sur"],"en":["South"]},"piscina":false,"parking":false,"jardin":false,"estado":"Available"}